1
00:06:06,666 --> 00:06:12,666
Nothing is what it seems

2
00:12:13,333 --> 00:12:19,333
The Illusionist is a fantasy, drama, thriller film directed by Neil Burger.

3
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:26,000
With his eye on a lovely aristocrat, a gifted illusionist named Eisenheim uses
his powers to win her away from her betrothed, a crown prince.

4
00:24:26,666 --> 00:24:32,666
But Eisenheim's scheme creates tumult within the monarchy and
ignites the suspicion of a dogged inspector.

5
00:30:33,333 --> 00:30:39,333
Eisenheim, played by Edward Norton.

6
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:46,000
Inspector Uhl, played by Paul Giamatti.

7
00:42:46,666 --> 00:42:52,666
Sophie, played by Jessica Biel.

8
00:48:53,333 --> 00:48:59,333
Crown Prince Leopold, played by Rufus Sewell.

9
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Josef Fischer, played by Eddie Marsan.

10
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
Young Eisenheim, played by Aaron Taylor-Johnson.

11
01:07:13,333 --> 01:07:19,333
The Illusionist is a 2006 American romantic mystery film written and directed by Neil
Burger and starring Edward Norton, Paul Giamatti, and Jessica Biel.

12
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
Based loosely on Steven Millhauser's short story "Eisenheim the Illusionist", it tells the story of Eisenheim, a magician
in turn-of-the-century Vienna, who reunites with his childhood love, a woman far above his social standing.

13
01:19:26,666 --> 01:19:32,666
It also depicts a fictionalized version of the Mayerling incident.

14
01:25:33,333 --> 01:25:39,333
It premiered at the 2006 Sundance Film Festival and opened the 2006 Seattle International Film Festival; it was
distributed in limited release to theaters on August 18, 2006 and expanded nationwide on September 1.

15
01:31:40,000 --> 01:31:46,000
It was a critical and commercial success.

16
01:37:46,666 --> 01:37:52,666
The film explores themes of princess, magic, rivalry, love, vienna, austria.

17
01:43:53,333 --> 01:43:59,333
The tone is emotional and intense.
